            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) A teacher on continuing contract or professional service contract, who has been granted long-term leave of absence may return to duty without prejudice upon the expiration of his leave. He shall retain full credit for years of teaching service prior to the leave and his continuing contract or professional service contract status.",
