        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) A teacher desiring to return from leave prior to the date of intent to return shall be allowed to return to duty only when a vacancy exists for which the teacher is certified and/or qualified. No new teacher shall be hired for such vacancies until any teacher desiring to return early from leave has been placed.",
            "block_bbox": [
                114,
                184,
                501,
