        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Upon the request of the teacher, one (1) extension of up to one (1) year shall be granted for long-term medical leave and one (1) extension of up to one (1) year may be granted for other long-term leaves. The Superintendent or his designee may grant an additional extension.",
            "block_bbox": [
